07. Register CSR-C (Device) — neither sub matches
=================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/csourceRegistrations/urn:CSR:C
Content-Length: 0




08. Dump ftClient — still four; CSR-C matched neither sub
=========================================================
[]

--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
ftClientStop
corDbDrop
